   "body": "Coordinator: confirmed at production size by #263 (win2, \u03c9/\u03c9\u221e = 1.10, K 33, J 1000, 960 bits). Main's 2-worker and 3-worker files are bit for bit equal. \u03c3\u2081\u2086 equals the original 3-worker value in all 20 digits and lies within the 1.4e-18 spread of the earlier summation orders. Wall time against the original code: +4.3% with 3 workers and +0.6% with 2, under differing load (raw I263-win2, fbbabd1).",
